WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.290 --> 00:00:07.180
Archie Robinson:
A life lesson that I think I got from football

00:00:07.180 --> 00:00:13.500
is how to learn to live with each person and
react to each person. I played linebacker,

00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:19.650
and then safety, and then I played a little
offense, defensive end, too. I remember my

00:00:19.650 --> 00:00:25.500
freshman year Muddy saying, "We're going to
have a good team. We'll start out with a small

00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:32.119
group of people, and then as it grows, we'll
see it getting bigger and blossom." Those

00:00:32.119 --> 00:00:39.770
are the kinds of things that I saw with Muddy.
He would work to see that thing blossom out.

00:00:39.770 --> 00:00:47.860
Regardless of what kind of athlete you were,
he was going to reach out to say, "I love you."

00:00:47.860 --> 00:00:55.420
Everything he did was like that. That was
four years in college, two years outside of

00:00:55.420 --> 00:01:01.160
college. The first year I played with the
Dolphins. The second year I went and played

00:01:01.160 --> 00:01:08.680
for a minor league team at Miami. It was playing
football, but it wasn't going anywhere. Muddy

00:01:08.680 --> 00:01:14.750
had me come in. "I want you to be my defensive
backfield coach."

00:01:14.750 --> 00:01:21.760
After the five years of coaching there, I
got married. We've been all around the world

00:01:21.760 --> 00:01:30.799
now. I was really in it to coach football,
to coach basketball, to coach track, to coach

00:01:30.799 --> 00:01:39.170
all other sports. Thirty-eight years at the
high school level: football, baseball, basketball.

00:01:39.170 --> 00:01:45.780
That's what I wanted to do. Being an All-American,
we've got to work together, run your lives

00:01:45.780 --> 00:01:50.460
together. That means you've got to tackle
together. That means you've got to work hard

00:01:50.460 --> 00:01:57.880
together. That means you've got to pick up
a stone and throw it further. You just can't

00:01:57.880 --> 00:01:59.590
give up; you just can't.

